  "html": "<div class=\"mm mm-masthead mm-mast--photo\">\n  <div class=\"mm-masthead__inner\">\n   <div class=\"mm-masthead__copy\">\n    <span class=\"mm-masthead__kicker\">Connect</span>\n    <h1>Where to find the work &mdash; and <em>me</em>.</h1>\n    <p class=\"mm-masthead__lede\">Email is the fastest route for supervision enquiries and collaboration. Everything else below points at the same record, indexed by different institutions.</p>\n   </div>\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"/assets/images/murtadha-portrait-editorial.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Mohd Murtadha bin Mohamad\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mm mm-sec\">\n  <div class=\"mm-inner\">\n    <div class=\"mm-eyebrow-row\"><span class=\"mm-eyebrow\">01 &mdash; Direct</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-tiles\">\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"mailto:murtadha@utm.my?subject=PhD%20supervision%20inquiry\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Supervision</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">murtadha@utm.my</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">Send a CV and a one-page proposal.</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"mailto:murtadha@utm.my?subject=Research%20collaboration\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Collaboration &amp; consultancy</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">murtadha@utm.my</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">Research partnerships, advisory work, training.</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mm mm-sec mm-sec--tint\">\n  <div class=\"mm-inner\">\n    <div class=\"mm-eyebrow-row\"><span class=\"mm-eyebrow\">02 &mdash; Scholarly profiles</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-tiles\">\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1478-0138\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">ORCID</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">0000-0002-1478-0138</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">Persistent researcher identifier.</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"https://www.scopus.com/authid/detail.uri?authorId=16033644000\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Scopus</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">Author ID 16033644000</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">80 indexed documents, 2005&ndash;2026.</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"https://www.webofscience.com/wos/author/record/C-9887-2011\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Web of Science</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">ResearcherID C-9887-2011</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">35 Core Collection records &middot; 183 verified peer reviews.</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"/cv/\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Full record</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">Curriculum vitae</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">Appointments, grants, teaching, service, downloads.</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mm mm-sec\">\n  <div class=\"mm-inner\">\n    <div class=\"mm-eyebrow-row\"><span class=\"mm-eyebrow\">03 &mdash; Elsewhere</span></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--mm-body);max-width:60ch;margin-bottom:28px\">Connect with me on LinkedIn for research, postgraduate supervision, academic activities, and industry collaboration.</p>\n    <div class=\"mm-tiles\">\n      <a class=\"mm-tile\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohd-murtadha-mohamad/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__k\">Professional network</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__n\">LinkedIn</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-tile__m\">Research, teaching, and industry engagement.</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mm mm-sec mm-contact\">\n  <div class=\"mm-inner\">\n    <h2>Let&rsquo;s talk research, supervision, or collaboration.</h2>\n    <a class=\"mm-contact__mail\" href=\"mailto:murtadha@utm.my\">murtadha@utm.my</a>\n  </div>\n</di